# This repository is a text-parsing system whose app runs on Windows. Git's
# default there is a CRLF checkout, and Node does not translate line endings the
# way Python's text mode does — so a parser written against \n silently stops
# matching on the machine the app actually ships to. That shipped once: the
# document-type list came back empty on Windows and the Design tab refused every
# request. Check everything out with LF so a parser sees the same bytes
# everywhere, and let Git detect binaries on its own.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.docx binary
*.dotx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip  binary
